WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:06.200
# I just can't seem to find it

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:12.800
# So, I've made my mind up
I must live my life alone

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:15.840
# I know it's not the easy way

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.400
# I guess I've always known

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.920
# I'd say goodbye to love... #

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:24.920
Uh...

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.640
(PANTS REPEATEDLY)

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:32.480
(GRU YELLS)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.040
(TYRES SCREECH)

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:40.560
Mini-Boss!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.400
Oh, no.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.480
I'm sorry!
I thought you'd be impressed!

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.720
Could I just speak to Belle Bottom?
She'll...

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.400
(MUFFLED SCREAM)

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:55.800
(GASPS)

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.480
Wild Knuckles!
(YELLS EXCITEDLY)

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:02.280
You're alive?

00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:06.000
Wow. My favourite villain
is also my kidnapper?

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:09.240
This could be a great opportunity
if you don't kill me. (CHUCKLES)

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.000
Shut up and give me the stone.

00:01:12.080 --> 00:01:16.120
Oh, yes, the stone.
Here's the thing about that.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:18.480
Kind of a funny story.
Give it to him!

00:01:18.520 --> 00:01:20.600
(GASPS) (GRUNTS REPEATEDLY)

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:27.560
And it's all going to go south
very quickly.

00:01:28.720 --> 00:01:29.800
(EYES RATTLE)

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:31.880
What the heck is this?

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.800
(EFFORT GRUNT)
(THUD)

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:41.840
(GASPS) (SCREAMS)

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:44.520
(SCREAMS)

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:50.240
Where is it, boy?
I don't have it! I don't have it!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:53.280
I know you're hiding it somewhere.
I'm not, I'm not! I swear!

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.880
Cross my heart and hope to die,
stick a needle in my eye!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.280
Don't actually do that, though.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:59.360
Somebody bring me a phone.
(PHONE CHIMES)

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:06.000
Call home. It's ransom time.
No, no, no!

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:08.200
My mom will probably pay you
to keep me!

00:02:08.240 --> 00:02:11.240
(CHUCKLES)
Good one. Call!

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:16.120
(TELEPHONE DIAL CLACKS)

00:02:22.520 --> 00:02:23.760
(PIGEONS COO)

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:27.640
(TELEPHONE RINGS)
(PANTING)

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:30.360
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.440
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:37.680
(GIGGLES)

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:38.720
(SCREAMS)

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.600
(TELEPHONE RINGS)

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:45.520
Hello.
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.160
Who is this?
Kevin. Kevin... Le minion.

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:50.280
Kevin Le what?
Le minion.

00:02:50.320 --> 00:02:52.560
You kidding me? You got henchmen?

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:55.000
Well, that's the end of that.
(GASPS)

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:56.120
Mini-Boss?

00:02:56.160 --> 00:02:58.880
Listen, you. Bring the stone to me
in San Francisco.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:01.280
6830 Green Street. You got it?

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.480
(STAMMERS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)
Now, you got two days,

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.680
or you are never gonna
see your little boss again.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.560
(GASPS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:12.280
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.760
Otto...
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.840
(INHALES THROUGH TEETH)

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.680
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.720
Ah! OK, OK, OK.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.040
Uh-hm. Ya?

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.200
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:30.880
(YELLS) (BABBLES)

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:35.640
Otto...
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:38.280
OK, si, si, si.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:39.920
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:44.000
(GASPS) (SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.320
# Ramones: HEY HO LET'S GO #

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.720
Otto...
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:53.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)
OK, go, go, go!

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.640
(MUSIC CONTINUES)

00:03:58.560 --> 00:03:59.880
Huh? Oh...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.000
Oh, the stone!

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.080
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:06.400
Gave that to my uncle.
It's more his style.

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:10.760
Oh.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.560
(SINISTER MUSIC)

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.200
(GASPS)

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:19.280
(ENGINE ROARS)

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:22.960
(SPEAKS MINIONESE FRANTICALLY)

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:24.040
(GROANS)

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.040
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.480
(YELLS) (PANTS)

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:30.680 --> 00:04:35.200
Ugh! I told you. I don't know
where he went, you stupid Twinkies!

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.880
(GROANS)

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.640
(GRUNTS) (YELLS)

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.120
(THUD)

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:45.440
(SPEAK MINIONESE)

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:50.720
Huh? Oh, not cool, man!

00:04:50.760 --> 00:04:56.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:04:56.720 --> 00:04:57.720
(HORN HONKS)

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:06.200
San Francisco...
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.640
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:14.520
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:16.400
(WHIMPERS)

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:21.360
Let's rock and roll!
Time to get our stone back.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:24.040
We're coming for you, Mr Gru!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:25.760
Hallelujah!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.160
(GROWLS) (LAUGHS)

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:32.680
Woop, woop, woop, woop, woop!
(LAUGHS)

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.200
(PINCERS CLANG)
Smash! Smash!

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:39.520
(ORGAN MUSIC)

